{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"arrow_bundle","model_identifier":"arrow_bundle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## arrow_bundle\n\nAmmunition bundle.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -2.0..2.0, z -13.0..12.0 (size 4.0 x 4.0 x 25.0 u = 11 x 11 x 70 cm).\nArrow bundle: 10 arrows tied with cord at two points (shafts, a cluster of heads and a fletching brush). 25 u long. Origin at the centre of the bundle; lies along Z (heads -Z). Carried in a hand (origin = grip) or stacked lying down at forges and storehouses (bottom at y = -2). Tip textures as `arrow`.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined tips.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `arrow_bundle_flint.png`, `arrow_bundle_bronze.png`, `arrow_bundle_iron_bloom.png`, `arrow_bundle_iron_wrought.png`, `arrow_bundle_iron_refined.png`, `arrow_bundle_steel.png`, `arrow_bundle_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## arrow_bundle\n\nAmmunition bundle.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -2.0..2.0, z -13.0..12.0 (size 4.0 x 4.0 x 25.0 u = 11 x 11 x 70 cm).\nArrow bundle: 10 arrows tied with cord at two points (shafts, a cluster of heads and a fletching brush). 25 u long. Origin at the centre of the bundle; lies along Z (heads -Z). Carried in a hand (origin = grip) or stacked lying down at forges and storehouses (bottom at y = -2). Tip textures as `arrow`.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined tips.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `arrow_bundle_flint.png`, `arrow_bundle_bronze.png`, `arrow_bundle_iron_bloom.png`, `arrow_bundle_iron_wrought.png`, `arrow_bundle_iron_refined.png`, `arrow_bundle_steel.png`, `arrow_bundle_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"shafts","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":fals